Package: leopard-lang
Version: 0.4.0-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtmultimedia
Maintainer: Chuck Finch <chuck@fragillidae.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/CFFinch62/LEOPARD-IDE
Description: Leopard language runtime, CLI, and companion IDE
 Leopard is a beginner-friendly language for writing desktop GUI programs.
 This package installs the language runtime, the leopard CLI, and the
 Leopard IDE with a desktop launcher and icon.
